		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"5","text":"# №121 — Arrival — flow\n\n**Card** №121\n**Day** Cold Open\n\nChapter note: [[01 №121 — Arrival]]\n\n---\n\nWorking surface, not canon. Fill from the chapter note, never the other way round. 🔧 marks nothing settled.\n\nStructure: [[The Day Loop]] · [[Saving]]\nLocks: [[Scope Ledger]]"},
