		{"id":"cutscenes","type":"text","x":1100,"y":0,"width":460,"height":216,"text":"## Cutscenes\n\n- **The transition.** Night beach, fog, the day after the declaration. Close on [[Otto]]'s face → zoom in → background and lighting change → zoom out, and he is in a moist tram. The bell is the hinge.\n- Dusk on [[Street and Tram]]; TV-style title sequence.","color":"6"},
		{"id":"npcdialogue","type":"text","x":1100,"y":276,"width":460,"height":150,"text":"## NPC dialogue\n\n- [[Leon]] in the [[Lobby]] — the cigarette vanish, the key to [[Room 202]], the lift line."},
		{"id":"keyitem","type":"text","x":1680,"y":0,"width":460,"height":150,"text":"## Key item\n\nNone. The camera is a tool, not a key item.","color":"2"},
		{"id":"photographs","type":"text","x":1680,"y":210,"width":460,"height":150,"text":"## Photographs\n\nNone — the camera arrives at the end.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"corkboard","type":"text","x":2260,"y":0,"width":460,"height":150,"text":"## Corkboard\n\n- The board is unpacked: ritual pins, and the sealed envelope marked \"A.\" See [[The Corkboard Thread]].","color":"3"},
		{"id":"nightdream","type":"text","x":2260,"y":210,"width":460,"height":216,"text":"## Night & dream\n\n- Tape #1. [[Pip]]'s blueprint arrives under the door mid-tape.\n- On tape, Otto says he can smell [[Anna]]. Nothing confirms it.\n- **Dream 0 — [[Renner]]'s Calling.** The camera is issued: RETURN UPON TERMINATION OF TENANCY.","color":"6"}
